# Context guard for AI coding agents and ripgrep-based tooling (file listing, search, @ mentions).
# NOTE: This does NOT affect Git tracking. firmware/*.bin intentionally stays in the repository.

# PlatformIO build state and library cache
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/

# Vendored TFT_eSPI sample sketches (313 files, ~29 MB) - open only for example-related tasks
lib/modified_TFT_eSPI/examples/

# Graphic/animation source assets (~22 MB, binary)
assets/

# Large documentation media (docs/**/*.md, *.txt and *.url stay readable)
docs/**/*.jpg
docs/**/*.png
docs/**/*.pdf
docs/**/*.docx
docs/**/*.xlsx
docs/**/*.kicad_sch

# Binary artifacts and media
*.bin
*.exe
*.bmp
*.clk
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.pdf

# Machine-local values (COM port map, private paths) - keep them out of search results,
# file listings and @ mentions. Read `.local/` explicitly only when a flash/monitor task needs it.
# Agent rule/prompt files are deliberately NOT listed here: they are meant to be loaded by the
# respective tool. Git-side protection for them lives in .git/info/exclude.
.local/

# Caches / generated editor state
.vscode/c_cpp_properties.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
